Cell["Handing the circuit to the engine", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"57868ed1-450c-c474-7dbd-279b6cbeaf5e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For validation only: the engine simulates states, so this is how one checks \
that the emitted circuit really measures the generators we think it does. ",
 Cell[BoxData["R"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0c5e608e-35dc-f74f-3466-79e8bc6edd95"],
 " has no unitary form and is dropped, ",
 Cell[BoxData["M"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1a1e4090-3303-05ed-4a26-59da46b66f37"],
 " is not a gate either, and ",
 Cell[BoxData["Vdg"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "10256af3-3972-af7a-41da-83bdb804f240"],
 " expands to three ",
 Cell[BoxData["V"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "457602f1-d86e-ac86-730d-9bbad918f6ec"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"499f95c1-a958-6c18-7fa4-0caac8ed3762"],

