Cell["\<\
One block is the identity, which is the regression that keeps the rest of the \
package out of this file's way.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"09e13884-5cc5-f650-3f9e-b1ee5571dcba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["registerConjugate"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "29829495-262a-abaa-5fb1-0ddf53dcf9f0"],
 " is how a claim about a gate gets checked instead of cited: put a Pauli in \
as the frame before the circuit starts, push it through, read the frame \
afterwards. Phases are dropped, as everywhere in the frame propagator, so \
what comes back is the action on the Pauli group modulo sign \[LongDash] \
which is exactly what \"is this the logical CNOT\" asks."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"136212ad-a4c2-b9f3-4111-8bf6cd740bd9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

